HST Office: ribbon tabs and groups of Writer, Sheets and Slides in the order of Word, Excel and PowerPoint.

Sheets: Page Layout and Formulas before Data; Styles, Editing, Tables, Illustrations, Charts, Links, Symbols, Function
Library, Calculation, Sheet Options, Workbook Views, Window. Slides: Layout tab dissolved (commands moved), Transitions
and Animations tabs, Drawing, Customize. Writer: Design and Mailings tabs, Page Setup, Compare, Protect. No command is
removed; rarely used ones move to another tab. Tab and group names are Vietnamese in translations/source/vi.

License: these upstream files remain under their original license (MPL-2.0).
